{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QecqqF8Z2Q1793138781.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：受東北季候風影響，今明兩日廣東沿岸風勢較大。隨著高空反氣旋增強，本周後期廣東天色普遍晴朗，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。預料一股偏東氣流會在周末期間影響華南沿岸，該區雲量增多。另一股東北季候風會在下周初至中期影響華南。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲，早晚有一兩陣雨。日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約28度。吹和緩至清勁東風，離岸及高地吹強風。</p><p></p><p>展望：未來兩三日日間大致天晴及乾燥。星期日雲量增多。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:21:23.197668+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:13.909309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:18:29.670334+00:00","content_hash":"7a12ca56cd745fd72682c51d2b740c6d930b52ea38c3d5cb3f7ac66192f46a5a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:21:23.197668+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}